<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37178" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερέω</span></b>  (A), 
			Att.
		
		
			contr.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερῶ,</span>
		fut. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξεῖπον</span>
		(q.v.):—I <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>will speak</i>
			<i>out, tell out, utter aloud,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> always abs. in sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.286
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				12.215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.365
			</span></i>, al.; in tmesi, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τοι ἐρέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.204
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				233
			</span></i>, al.: c. acc. in Trag., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τἀληθὲς ἐξερῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					800
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				219
			</span></i>, etc.: c. dupl. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῦτά τοι νὼ πᾶς τις ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					984
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὅτι . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					325
				</span></i>
			:—after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, also pf.
				Act.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξείρηκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					350
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				374
			</span></i>: 3sg.
			plpf.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξείρητο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					984
				</span></i>
			: 3sg.
			fut.
			
				Pass.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξειρήσεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1186
				</span></i>
			.</div>
